# Acid Alien, the July head (ticket 45): a sleek black-green chitin head swept back into a long cranium with plates on the back, huge glossy
# black slanted eyes (no iris, nothing else in them), a small needle-toothed mouth between hooked insect mandibles, two bent antennae with
# glowing tips and drools of acid (emission: the acid yellow-green, also its blood).
# Frame (the soldier's head_top socket, ticket 43): the origin is the socket, 1.815 m over the soles; the head faces +Z, +Y is up. The
# size and the height come from the head part (content/parts/alien_head.sdf): normalized to the common size, the chin 4 cm lower than
# phase 1's (at 1.525 m, over the neck's top at 1.569 whose stub is inside it). The head turns on the Head bone, 0.25 m under the origin.
# The eyes are part of the head (a glossy black ellipsoid each), no eye part.
format 1

# No collider (the hit shape of the head is a number in the registry), and never culled before 200 m: the head is what reads at range
collider none
cull 200

Detail detail=0.652
    Part part=alien_head
